<% content_for :title, "Dotfiles — My Omarchy" %>
<%= render "my/shared/page_head", crumb: "Dotfiles", title: "Dotfiles",
      summary: "Whole-config snapshots pushed from your machines. The newest #{DotfileBundle::KEEP_PER_USER} are kept; omarchy my sync pull fetches the latest (or any by id) and restores it after showing you the diff." %>

<div class="container my-page">
  <% if @bundles.any? %>
    <table class="table">
      <thead><tr><th>Pushed</th><th>From</th><th>Files</th><th>Size</th><th>Omarchy</th><th></th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <% @bundles.each do |bundle| %>
          <tr>
            <td><%= link_to "#{time_ago_in_words(bundle.created_at)} ago", my_dotfile_path(bundle) %></td>
            <td><%= bundle.device_name.presence || "—" %></td>
            <td><%= bundle.file_count %><% if bundle.encryption_age? %> <span class="badge">encrypted</span><% end %></td>
            <td class="muted"><%= number_to_human_size(bundle.size_bytes) %></td>
            <td class="muted"><%= bundle.omarchy_version || "—" %></td>
            <td class="actions">
              <%= link_to "Download", download_my_dotfile_path(bundle), class: "button button--ghost button--small" %>
              <%= button_to "Delete", my_dotfile_path(bundle), method: :delete, class: "button button--ghost button--small",
                    form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Delete this snapshot? Machines can no longer pull it." } } %>
            </td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  <% else %>
    <div class="my-empty">
      <p>No snapshots yet. On any connected machine:</p>
      <pre>$ omarchy my sync push</pre>
    </div>
  <% end %>

  <section class="my-section">
    <h2>What gets synced</h2>
    <p>The client bundles <code>~/.config/omarchy</code>, <code>~/.config/hypr</code>, and the app
      configs Omarchy manages (terminal, editor, shell). Keys and credentials are excluded on the
      machine and refused by the server if they slip through: SSH, GPG, AWS, keyrings, browser
      profiles, agent API keys.</p>
    <p>Prefer nobody but you can read a snapshot? <code>omarchy my sync push --encrypt</code> encrypts
      the bundle with <a href="https://age-encryption.org">age</a> before upload. The server stores it
      as-is and shows only the file list the client declared.</p>
  </section>
</div>
